# R8 discovery (spec/r8-guided-clinical-workspace) — the two discovery
# deliverables must be version-controlled. Narrow exception to the global
# `*.md` + `frontend/docs/` ignores above, mirroring the backend's
# RH-001/RH-002 repository-hygiene precedent (docs excluded by a broad
# pattern were invisible to version control; narrow, explicit allowlist).
!frontend/docs/
frontend/docs/*
!frontend/docs/R8-guided-clinical-workspace/
!frontend/docs/R8-guided-clinical-workspace/*.md
